          <a href="/shop/category/case-studies-class-5"><span class="dd-ic">📒</span><span>Class 5<span class="dd-sub">Chapter-wise case studies</span></span></a>
          <a href="/shop/category/case-studies-class-6"><span class="dd-ic">📕</span><span>Class 6<span class="dd-sub">Chapter-wise case studies</span></span></a>
